WEBVTT

00:43.918 --> 00:48.631
DOONA!

01:05.648 --> 01:08.151
If you don't like it,
you can pull your hand away.

01:50.193 --> 01:54.989
EPISODE 4
THE UNEXPECTED

02:01.788 --> 02:06.668
WATER FILTRATION PLANT PLANNING
FILTRATION TARGET PARTICULATE MATTER

02:17.804 --> 02:20.515
WOLMI THEME PARK
STAFF

02:24.394 --> 02:26.521
Sorry,
the number you're trying to reach

02:26.604 --> 02:27.689
is currently unavailable.

02:27.772 --> 02:29.482
Please try again later.

03:11.900 --> 03:13.359
When do you take your lunch break?

03:14.068 --> 03:16.279
Oh, um, I don't think
I have time for lunch today.

03:16.362 --> 03:17.322
Seriously?

03:18.740 --> 03:20.116
That's disappointing.

03:20.200 --> 03:21.826
Mmm, sorry, Doona.

03:22.535 --> 03:25.121
Why do you
always apologize for everything?

03:26.915 --> 03:31.127
Okay, look, no need to worry about me.
I didn't come here to see you anyway.

03:32.212 --> 03:33.463
Doing things alone is fun.

03:46.017 --> 03:47.936
The ride will begin momentarily.

03:48.019 --> 03:50.521
To all passengers,
please pull down the safety bar

03:50.605 --> 03:51.981
down to your waist until it clicks.

03:52.065 --> 03:53.566
- Thank you.
- Whoo!

03:54.067 --> 03:55.360
Whoo!

04:05.828 --> 04:08.039
Whoo!

04:08.623 --> 04:11.000
Wow, this is actually not fun at all.

04:54.961 --> 04:56.546
Oh! Are you done?

05:11.686 --> 05:13.396
You're just loving that meal, aren't you?

05:13.980 --> 05:16.149
I haven't been able
to eat anything all day.

05:23.531 --> 05:24.907
Once, there was this concert I had.

05:27.118 --> 05:28.953
It got canceled due to the weather.

05:30.413 --> 05:32.582
If felt like a gift, you know?

05:32.665 --> 05:35.001
I found myself
having all this free time for once.

05:35.585 --> 05:38.171
So I really wanted
to do something special with it.

05:38.755 --> 05:40.590
But I couldn't figure out what to do.

05:42.467 --> 05:43.885
At the time, I didn't know why.

05:45.094 --> 05:47.555
Then the day came when I realized,

05:48.473 --> 05:50.892
aside from singing
and performing on stage,

05:51.809 --> 05:54.062
I had never done anything else in my life.

05:59.108 --> 06:00.443
It wasn't until later

06:01.569 --> 06:02.945
I began to wonder a lot.

06:03.988 --> 06:06.866
What would happen if I couldn't sing
or perform onstage anymore?

06:08.034 --> 06:09.911
What would become of my life then?

06:10.495 --> 06:11.788
Who is Lee Doona?

06:13.331 --> 06:14.540
I didn't know myself.

06:15.291 --> 06:16.250
I felt alone.

06:17.835 --> 06:19.921
What if I could never amount to anything?

06:23.925 --> 06:24.759
Anyways,

06:26.094 --> 06:28.346
I think I'm doing
a lot better than I thought.

06:28.429 --> 06:30.014
Although, I'm still figuring it out.

06:31.057 --> 06:31.891
Glad to hear that.

06:36.187 --> 06:37.647
KOREAN HISTORY, TOEIC MASTERY

06:37.730 --> 06:38.940
How about you?

06:39.732 --> 06:40.858
What are your aspirations?

06:40.942 --> 06:43.694
I assume your dream wasn't
to overwork yourself every day.

06:46.072 --> 06:47.448
Uh,

06:47.532 --> 06:49.367
we're here
eating jajangmyeon late at night,

06:49.450 --> 06:51.202
so, um, isn't that enough of a win?

06:54.789 --> 06:58.709
For me, um, living a normal life
is all I've ever really wanted, you know?

07:00.461 --> 07:01.879
That's enough for me, I think.

07:12.140 --> 07:13.307
Have a fortune cookie.

07:19.021 --> 07:20.857
Here's hoping one of us will be lucky.

07:28.364 --> 07:29.490
Huh…

07:34.287 --> 07:35.580
Hold on, um…

07:35.663 --> 07:37.707
I thought fortunes
were supposed to be positive.

07:38.291 --> 07:39.459
Who made these?

07:39.542 --> 07:40.460
What's it say?

07:40.543 --> 07:41.961
"You will face your worst enemy,

07:42.044 --> 07:44.589
and you'll be as helpless
as a mouse is to a cat."

07:44.672 --> 07:46.716
Are you the mouse?

07:48.301 --> 07:50.720
"So you should prepare
for the unexpected soon,

07:50.803 --> 07:52.680
or else the consequences
could be super dire."

07:52.763 --> 07:54.849
So much for trying to lighten things up.

07:55.808 --> 07:56.642
Maybe next time.

07:56.726 --> 07:58.227
It's all right.

07:59.020 --> 08:01.230
I never make enemies,
so I'm not worried at all.

08:02.106 --> 08:02.940
That's true.

08:06.611 --> 08:07.904
I'm in a good mood, anyway…

08:10.948 --> 08:12.700
'cause this is some good jajangmyeon.

08:14.952 --> 08:15.828
Also true.

08:20.958 --> 08:23.794
- How about we have another date sometime?
- Like when?

08:23.878 --> 08:26.130
On a day when the weather is so amazing,

08:26.839 --> 08:28.508
a day so good, we can't stay inside.

08:36.265 --> 08:37.600
This is so good.

08:43.356 --> 08:45.233
- Hey, Won-jun.
- Hmm?

08:46.567 --> 08:48.528
You shouldn't overwork so much.

08:51.072 --> 08:54.200
You're allowed to take it easy.
Take care of yourself for once.

08:55.535 --> 08:56.494
Just like I am.

08:58.246 --> 09:01.123
Relax a little here and there
and be lazy once in a while.

09:02.625 --> 09:03.626
Who cares, right?

09:08.005 --> 09:08.839
What?

09:10.258 --> 09:11.384
I do take it easy.

09:11.968 --> 09:14.178
In fact, I have bad thoughts.

09:15.388 --> 09:16.722
When I moved away from home,

09:17.390 --> 09:19.100
I left behind a kid sister.

09:19.600 --> 09:22.061
She's sick,
and our mother takes care of her alone.

09:22.562 --> 09:24.647
But for some reason,
I don't have a heavy heart.

09:26.482 --> 09:27.984
In fact, I'm a little happier.

09:28.776 --> 09:32.238
Although, I felt a little guilty…
for a while.

09:33.864 --> 09:35.533
That's not a bad thought, Won-jun?

09:37.660 --> 09:38.703
Yeah, it is.

09:39.704 --> 09:42.456
It's super bad.
I've never told anyone before today.

09:43.874 --> 09:44.875
You're the first.

09:58.848 --> 10:00.808
Hey, what's so funny?
Why are you laughing?

10:05.896 --> 10:08.316
- Uh, what is it?
- Seriously.

10:09.025 --> 10:10.318
Wait. Why are you laughing?

10:11.902 --> 10:15.114
- Not telling.
- Oh, come on. What is it? Tell me, Doona.

10:15.197 --> 10:17.950
- Oh, you're so adorable.
- What?

11:09.043 --> 11:12.254
TIME TO MOVE ON FROM
YOUR PAST RELATIONSHIP AND START ANEW!

11:12.338 --> 11:14.840
SEIZE EVERY
OPPORTUNITY TO CHANGE YOUR FATE

11:22.098 --> 11:23.808
What? Face an enemy?

11:24.475 --> 11:25.976
You don't have any of those, do you?

11:26.060 --> 11:28.771
Exactly. It's all one big superstition.

11:29.355 --> 11:30.856
Do you still have the fortune?

11:31.440 --> 11:33.651
Give it to me. I'll throw it out for you.

11:35.486 --> 11:36.987
It should be burned.

11:39.323 --> 11:41.242
So what did Doona say about it all?

11:41.325 --> 11:43.494
- Who do you think you are?
- Oh, what the…

11:43.577 --> 11:45.413
I spent all that damn money

11:45.496 --> 11:46.914
for you to learn Korean,

11:46.997 --> 11:48.207
and you cheat on me?

11:48.791 --> 11:50.626
Whoa. Whoa. Whoa, hey!

11:50.710 --> 11:52.545
- Whoa, whoa!
- That's fucking mine!

11:52.628 --> 11:55.256
I told you to learn how to communicate,

11:55.339 --> 11:57.508
not to communicate with some bitch.

11:57.591 --> 11:58.509
Some bitch?

11:59.260 --> 12:02.471
Why are you angry?
I told you she's just a friend!

12:02.555 --> 12:04.306
Just a friend?
I call bullshit!

12:04.390 --> 12:06.934
You don't hang out with friends
wearing only boxers and socks.

12:10.146 --> 12:11.856
Hey, Dos Santos! You're an ass!

12:13.941 --> 12:15.776
Fuck you, you son of a bitch!
You hear that?

12:15.860 --> 12:18.654
You motherfucker! Get out of here!
You got it?

12:20.030 --> 12:21.949
Whoo!

12:22.032 --> 12:23.200
Thank you.

12:27.496 --> 12:29.248
Hey, what is it? Do you know her?

12:29.331 --> 12:30.708
Uh, no, I don't think so.

12:31.375 --> 12:33.169
I think I mistook her for someone else.

12:36.297 --> 12:37.590
- The fortune.
- Ah.

12:41.469 --> 12:43.012
- Let's go.
- Mm-hmm.

12:50.770 --> 12:51.896
Jin-ju.

12:53.147 --> 12:53.981
Uh-huh.

13:06.494 --> 13:07.578
What is it?

13:08.537 --> 13:10.498
Ah, shit, that bitch RA!

13:19.799 --> 13:21.926
DO NOT BLOCK
FAILURE TO COMPLY WILL RESULT IN EVICTION

13:22.009 --> 13:23.177
Hey! Hey!

13:23.260 --> 13:25.054
Open the door!

13:27.139 --> 13:31.769
Our revered comrade Choi I-ra has lead
in penalty points for 13 months now!

13:31.852 --> 13:33.187
You have my respect!

13:33.270 --> 13:35.189
A round of applause.

13:35.272 --> 13:36.857
- Whoo!
- Yes. Yes.

13:40.653 --> 13:42.196
PENALTY POINTS FOR MAY
WINNER: CHOI I-RA

13:42.279 --> 13:43.739
WARNING! EVICTION UPON 20 POINTS

13:48.577 --> 13:50.663
I'm being discriminated
because I didn't grow up here,

13:50.746 --> 13:51.914
pure and simple.

13:52.414 --> 13:54.291
I-ra, don't you have any remorse at all?

13:54.375 --> 13:55.209
Ah!

13:55.709 --> 13:57.837
Well, that's what happens
when you spend every night out

13:57.920 --> 13:59.171
getting so drunk.

13:59.296 --> 14:01.882
Or when you decided to smash up
all of those windows in the hallway.

14:01.966 --> 14:02.800
Remember?

14:02.883 --> 14:06.720
Hey, do you remember that time
she hosted the Pig Samba Festival?

14:06.804 --> 14:09.139
That was so freaking hilarious.

14:09.223 --> 14:11.433
The fact
that you haven't been kicked out yet

14:11.517 --> 14:13.185
feels like discrimination against us.

14:14.436 --> 14:17.857
I'll have you know I'm single now.
I won't be staying out, getting drunk.

14:17.940 --> 14:19.650
No sleeping at his place anymore.

14:20.359 --> 14:22.653
And there won't be
a Pig Samba Festival this year.

14:22.736 --> 14:23.612
Whoa.

14:24.697 --> 14:26.824
So, um, Buenos Aires and you
finally broke up?

14:26.907 --> 14:27.825
That's right.

14:27.908 --> 14:31.036
Hey, I'll have you know
that's the capital of Argentina.

14:31.120 --> 14:32.413
His name is Dos Santos.

14:32.496 --> 14:34.164
How did you get accepted here?

14:34.248 --> 14:36.792
Ugh, you're seriously so ignorant.
It's unbelievable.

14:36.876 --> 14:38.836
- What a fucking bastard.
- Jeez!

14:39.753 --> 14:41.255
Stay out of my life.

14:43.424 --> 14:45.050
Go die somewhere, you dick!

14:49.722 --> 14:51.223
Is she serious right now?

14:55.561 --> 14:56.729
Well, you know,

14:56.812 --> 15:00.441
we should probably take her
on our… well, our group blind date.

15:00.524 --> 15:01.775
That's an odd number.

15:01.859 --> 15:04.361
I can't take… this.

15:05.779 --> 15:09.408
Haven't they got a friend they can add?

15:21.420 --> 15:22.254
SO-MIN

15:22.338 --> 15:25.966
Won-jun, was the goddess
in the lecture hall the real Doona

15:26.050 --> 15:27.259
from Dream Sweet?

15:27.343 --> 15:30.554
Check out the link Seong-guk posted
in the department group chat.

15:34.183 --> 15:35.726
DREAM SWEET'S EX-LEAD-SINGER DOONA

15:38.395 --> 15:39.980
Unbelievable that a female idol

15:40.064 --> 15:41.649
is eating in the middle of the night.

15:41.732 --> 15:43.192
What a freaking cushy life she has.

15:43.275 --> 15:45.319
Dream Sweet is falling apart
since Doona left.

15:45.402 --> 15:47.863
Is he a non-celebrity?
That bastard should pay more tax.

15:47.947 --> 15:49.448
I hope this is an edited image.

15:49.531 --> 15:52.409
- I guess Lee Doona still has fans.
- She's notoriously rude.

15:52.493 --> 15:54.578
There's only a handful of them left.
The loud minority.

15:54.662 --> 15:57.873
If she wants to live like a normal
person, her bank account should match.

15:57.957 --> 16:01.502
She makes all the money she can,
then bails when she feels like it. LOL.

16:01.585 --> 16:04.129
Dream Sweet hasn't been able
to release a studio album

16:04.213 --> 16:06.256
since she deserted them.
Who does she think she is?

16:06.340 --> 16:07.466
Totally a dick move.

16:07.549 --> 16:09.843
- Has she completely retired?
- Fucking bitch.

16:09.927 --> 16:13.764
Nope, she'll be back
once the money runs out. 100%.

16:14.932 --> 16:17.017
LOOK AT HER LIVING A NORMAL LIFE
UNBELIEVABLE

16:31.907 --> 16:32.866
It's super hot.

16:39.957 --> 16:41.917
That picture of us
looked pretty good, hmm?

16:42.001 --> 16:44.420
It looked like an old Hong Kong flick.

16:45.170 --> 16:46.463
Doona, are you doing okay?

16:47.214 --> 16:48.549
Fascinating, isn't it?

16:49.049 --> 16:50.926
We were the only ones in there.

16:52.344 --> 16:54.471
Did our waiter take it then?

16:54.555 --> 16:55.389
Hmm.

16:58.308 --> 16:59.351
Why the long face?

17:02.354 --> 17:04.273
Do you feel your privacy was violated?

17:05.315 --> 17:07.276
No, I just feel bad for you that, uh,

17:08.569 --> 17:10.529
people are talking about you online.

17:12.990 --> 17:13.907
Like what?

17:15.075 --> 17:16.285
Are they trash-talking?

17:18.120 --> 17:19.747
They're so mean about it.

17:23.000 --> 17:25.335
You've never looked me up online
until now?

17:26.754 --> 17:28.630
I'm like a dumpster for public trash.

17:30.966 --> 17:32.342
I'm the girl

17:33.844 --> 17:35.512
everyone trash-talks.

17:36.847 --> 17:38.348
They say whatever they think about me.

17:42.436 --> 17:45.355
I've also been told my earnings
have to come from my looks

17:45.439 --> 17:47.232
'cause I have no talent.

17:47.816 --> 17:49.318
Luckily, I'm worth a lot.

17:50.819 --> 17:52.529
That makes this worthwhile.

17:54.073 --> 17:55.741
What? Really? They say all that?

17:56.325 --> 17:58.869
Wow, there are
some really annoying fuckers out there.

18:01.663 --> 18:02.831
Mmm, yup.

18:03.373 --> 18:04.583
Don't quit swearing. It's hot.

18:05.167 --> 18:06.001
What?

18:06.085 --> 18:06.960
Swear some more.

18:07.461 --> 18:09.254
- Please do it again.
- What? No.

18:09.963 --> 18:12.925
Hey, how come you never take things
seriously? Stop playing with me.

18:13.467 --> 18:16.428
Anyway, I'm glad to know
you're doing all right.

18:16.512 --> 18:17.638
I'll see you later, then.

18:32.111 --> 18:33.112
Hey, Doona.

18:34.238 --> 18:36.907
If you ever have to address the public,

18:36.990 --> 18:39.576
or do a press conference
or something in the future,

18:40.953 --> 18:41.995
You'll come with me?

18:43.330 --> 18:45.082
Well, if that's okay.

18:46.917 --> 18:48.669
And what would you say, Won-jun?

18:49.336 --> 18:50.504
That we're just good friends.

18:59.304 --> 19:02.141
Why don't you tell them
that we're more than just friends?

19:07.312 --> 19:09.148
Do you think you could handle it?

19:09.857 --> 19:12.359
Seriously?

19:13.861 --> 19:14.695
Ah.

19:16.655 --> 19:17.781
Hey, hold on!

19:19.241 --> 19:21.869
I'll come up with you. Hey, hey, wait.

19:23.704 --> 19:25.789
- Be honest, your heart was pounding.
- No, it wasn't.

19:25.873 --> 19:28.041
- That's not what your pupils said.
- Then, they lied.

19:29.585 --> 19:31.420
What would you wear
to the press conference?

19:31.503 --> 19:33.213
Um… a traditional hanbok.

19:35.382 --> 19:36.717
To a press conference?!

19:36.800 --> 19:38.969
Who wears hanbok to a press conference?

19:47.978 --> 19:49.688
TIME TO MOVE ON FROM
YOUR PAST RELATIONSHIP

19:49.771 --> 19:51.023
CHANGE YOUR FATE

20:03.076 --> 20:04.119
Dinner.

20:04.203 --> 20:05.746
Okay, thanks. Hmm.

20:11.752 --> 20:13.962
Do you girls use social media at all?

20:14.046 --> 20:16.965
I do have an account.
I don't use it though.

20:17.049 --> 20:19.343
Delete your accounts. No social media.

20:21.261 --> 20:22.179
Yes, sir.

20:27.643 --> 20:29.770
WOULD YOU LIKE TO DEACTIVATE
RATHER THAN DELETE?

20:30.604 --> 20:34.233
RECENT SIGHTING OF LEE DOONA EATING
WITH A MAN IN THE MIDDLE OF THE NIGHT

20:34.316 --> 20:35.859
IS SHE CRAZY?

21:20.153 --> 21:21.697
Wow, the weather is,

21:22.990 --> 21:24.408
in fact, amazing.

21:36.128 --> 21:36.962
Huh?

21:41.049 --> 21:43.093
YOU WILL FACE YOUR ENEMY
AT THE WORST MOMENT

21:43.176 --> 21:44.886
YOU'LL BE AS HELPLESS
AS A MOUSE IS TO A CAT

21:44.970 --> 21:46.179
What? What is this?

21:46.972 --> 21:48.807
I'm positive I gave this to Jin-ju.

21:49.933 --> 21:51.893
Oh, man, this is creepy as heck.

21:59.151 --> 22:00.819
Not today! Knock on wood!

22:04.031 --> 22:04.865
I'll knock twice!

22:24.426 --> 22:25.635
What are you up to?

22:26.845 --> 22:28.847
- Hmm?
- Are you going out?

22:29.723 --> 22:30.557
Me?

22:31.975 --> 22:33.143
I got a date.

22:35.479 --> 22:36.688
Who with?

22:37.981 --> 22:39.066
With you.

22:40.609 --> 22:41.443
What?

22:42.110 --> 22:44.613
We said if the weather was nice,
we'd go on a date?

22:45.322 --> 22:46.198
Oh.

22:47.366 --> 22:48.909
Well, I've got finals coming up.

22:50.786 --> 22:51.828
Hey, listen.

22:51.912 --> 22:53.830
Stop being boring and look at these eyes?

22:53.914 --> 22:56.500
See this eyeliner? I did it perfectly.

22:56.583 --> 22:58.210
Do you think this is easy?

22:58.835 --> 23:00.670
Compared to this, mine is harder.

23:02.714 --> 23:03.590
What will you wear?

23:10.847 --> 23:11.890
How's this, huh?

23:12.391 --> 23:14.559
Oh, I meant to tell you.
You should take some clothes.

23:14.643 --> 23:16.103
Given what happened recently,

23:16.186 --> 23:18.188
you should leave
some men's clothing at your place.

23:18.271 --> 23:20.899
It may deter future stalkers,
so take this.

23:20.982 --> 23:23.276
And… you should take this too.

23:25.946 --> 23:26.905
Wait just a minute.

23:28.198 --> 23:29.116
Hey, Yun-taek.

23:29.199 --> 23:31.535
Hey, hey, hey, Won-jun,
you've got to help me out.

23:32.035 --> 23:32.953
Why? What happened?

23:33.036 --> 23:35.414
I'll tell you
when you get here. Can you come now?

23:35.497 --> 23:36.623
Please come now, okay?

23:37.332 --> 23:38.333
Won-jun, listen to me.

23:38.417 --> 23:40.752
I won't live unless you come.

23:41.586 --> 23:42.879
I'll text you the address.

23:44.047 --> 23:45.215
Uh, uh…

23:45.298 --> 23:47.634
What? Um, hello?
Yun-taek, answer me. You there?

23:47.717 --> 23:48.552
Hello?

23:49.302 --> 23:50.512
What's going on?

23:50.595 --> 23:52.013
Sorry. I've got to get out of here.

23:52.097 --> 23:54.349
Yun-taek really needs me.
He said it was urgent.

23:54.433 --> 23:56.017
Why can't you just let him die instead?

23:56.101 --> 23:58.687
Um, would you just remember
to lock the door?

23:59.813 --> 24:01.022
I'll be back afterwards.

24:13.160 --> 24:15.203
- Anything yet?
- Not yet.

24:18.206 --> 24:19.332
Won-jun, hey!

24:20.584 --> 24:21.418
Yun-taek.

24:23.837 --> 24:26.214
- Was he cute?
- I definitely think I saw some potential.

24:26.298 --> 24:28.133
- He looks really good from behind.
- Let's go.

24:28.216 --> 24:30.469
Hey, are you all right? I was so worried.

24:30.552 --> 24:32.137
- What's wrong, Yun-taek?
- Yeah.

24:32.220 --> 24:34.306
Everything's fine. All good now, buddy!

24:34.389 --> 24:35.599
Oh. Look.

24:42.689 --> 24:44.107
He's cute as fuck.

24:44.191 --> 24:46.234
- Cute.
- He's way cute.

25:03.084 --> 25:04.461
Sorry about the holdup.

25:04.544 --> 25:06.213
Oh, no worries!

25:06.713 --> 25:08.006
So, how are you doing?

25:13.136 --> 25:17.682
I'd forgotten for way too long
that I did, in fact, have an enemy.

25:28.902 --> 25:33.365
Ah, it hurts!
Uh, my belly! I'm dying! I'm dying!

25:33.448 --> 25:34.491
SURGERY IN PROGRESS

25:37.035 --> 25:38.870
I-RA, 12/31, 11:59 P.M.
WON-JUN, 1/1, 12:00 A.M.

25:38.954 --> 25:41.957
That was
the beginning of the tragedy.

25:42.958 --> 25:44.459
- Oh, I've got it.
- Aw.

25:44.543 --> 25:47.587
Let's have them
marry each other so we can be in-laws.

25:47.671 --> 25:50.257
That would be so wonderful.

25:50.340 --> 25:51.758
Right?

25:58.765 --> 26:00.475
No.

26:04.062 --> 26:05.730
Stop it.

26:05.814 --> 26:07.732
Stop it. I don't wanna spin anymore.

26:07.816 --> 26:09.359
Start calling me Noona, then!

26:09.442 --> 26:12.028
You better say it or else I'll…

26:14.239 --> 26:15.532
No. No.

26:16.950 --> 26:19.244
Hey, have a bite of this.

26:20.036 --> 26:23.039
I don't want to. Stop!
I don't want any of it! Stop it!

26:23.123 --> 26:25.792
I told you to stop it.
I don't want any, huh?

26:25.875 --> 26:28.670
How dare you talk to me like that?
I'm your elder. Got it?

26:29.379 --> 26:30.505
Whatever.

26:30.589 --> 26:31.881
Here. Eat some more.

26:44.644 --> 26:46.813
Won-jun, my future husband,

26:46.896 --> 26:48.940
save yourself for me until we meet again.

26:49.024 --> 26:52.110
If you cheat on me, I'll curse you and
your descendants for three generations.

26:52.193 --> 26:53.111
Got it?

26:53.194 --> 26:54.404
I will return.

26:54.487 --> 26:55.739
I will be back.

27:03.371 --> 27:04.748
Lee Won-jun!

27:17.260 --> 27:20.764
At the age of 12,
Choi I-ra immigrated to Brazil,

27:20.847 --> 27:22.724
leaving me with 1,000 paper cranes,

27:22.807 --> 27:25.560
a curse,
and the impending doom of her return.

27:25.644 --> 27:29.189
Strangely, after her departure,
I finally started to grow taller.

27:29.272 --> 27:30.649
Here, have a beer.

27:30.732 --> 27:33.109
You seriously don't recognize me
from anywhere?

27:33.693 --> 27:34.736
No, we never met.

27:34.819 --> 27:38.031
Yangjin Healthcare Center
doesn't ring a bell either?

27:38.114 --> 27:39.032
I've never heard of it.

27:39.115 --> 27:41.576
So you've never been
to The Piano Academy either?

27:41.660 --> 27:42.494
Right.

27:43.119 --> 27:45.538
Sure, okay! Ah.

27:46.331 --> 27:47.374
I wonder why?

28:49.102 --> 28:49.936
Love shot!

28:50.019 --> 28:53.648
Hey, Mr. First-Time-That-We've-Met,
you're being very quiet, hmm?

28:53.732 --> 28:55.233
This'll be our first and last meeting.

28:55.316 --> 28:56.526
- That's what I think.
- Uh-huh!

28:56.609 --> 28:57.986
- Mm-hmm!
- Right.

28:58.069 --> 28:59.738
Ha.

28:59.821 --> 29:01.948
Huh.

29:05.994 --> 29:07.245
Everyone, take one.

29:14.753 --> 29:16.254
- Number one…
- Who's number one?

29:16.337 --> 29:17.547
Yeah, who is it?

29:18.173 --> 29:21.217
- Ha!
- Ooh, it's Choi I-ra.

29:21.301 --> 29:23.678
Okay, number one grab
the face of number four and--

29:23.762 --> 29:25.597
- Who's number four?
- Who is it?

29:25.680 --> 29:27.223
Ah!

29:27.307 --> 29:31.478
Grabs number four's face
and caresses it while…

29:31.561 --> 29:33.146
Make it hot.

29:33.229 --> 29:34.230
Make it hot!

29:34.314 --> 29:35.732
…you kiss him!

29:35.815 --> 29:37.233
Ah!

29:37.317 --> 29:40.695
Kiss! Kiss! Kiss! Kiss!

29:40.779 --> 29:43.281
- I love this. This is great.
- All right, then.

29:43.364 --> 29:45.950
Let's see how much longer
you can keep up this act.

29:46.034 --> 29:48.703
- Kiss!
- Kiss!

29:48.787 --> 29:50.163
Kiss!

29:50.246 --> 29:51.247
Go on.

29:52.624 --> 29:54.667
Whoa!

29:58.004 --> 30:00.006
There they go. They're gonna do it!

30:00.089 --> 30:02.509
Kiss! Kiss! Yeah!

30:02.592 --> 30:03.927
Kiss!

30:10.099 --> 30:11.518
Oh, oh, oh!

30:13.269 --> 30:15.396
Give it a rest, won't you, Choi I-ra?

30:15.480 --> 30:16.773
What's happening?

30:16.856 --> 30:19.192
- Punishment means I drink?
- Hey, wait. No. No!

30:19.275 --> 30:20.777
Won-jun, what are you guys doing?

30:20.860 --> 30:24.572
No, you have to. Stop! You're all mine!

30:48.096 --> 30:50.098
So you weren't kidnapped, then?

30:50.181 --> 30:51.015
Oh.

30:53.810 --> 30:55.562
Oh. Kidnapped?

30:55.645 --> 30:56.521
No, actually,

30:57.146 --> 30:59.023
it was a group blind date.

30:59.107 --> 31:00.108
Group date?

31:00.775 --> 31:01.609
Uh-huh.

31:04.487 --> 31:05.780
We met these girls, uh,

31:06.739 --> 31:09.409
and Won-jun was so sensational tonight.

31:09.492 --> 31:10.743
Uh-huh.

31:10.827 --> 31:14.080
The guy was, like, in rare form tonight

31:14.163 --> 31:15.456
and all spruced up.

31:15.540 --> 31:19.002
And the girls' eyes were all
twinkle, twinkle, baby, baby stars--

31:20.253 --> 31:21.588
Ow. Ah.

31:22.171 --> 31:24.257
So why hasn't he
come back from the date yet?

31:24.340 --> 31:25.967
Won-jun?

31:26.885 --> 31:28.386
Won-jun left with this

31:29.262 --> 31:31.097
little sexpot that he met there.

31:33.016 --> 31:36.394
The looks they were giving…
…were so hot.

31:37.103 --> 31:38.730
Like an explosion, mmm!

31:38.813 --> 31:40.523
So much chemistry.

31:42.275 --> 31:45.320
If I had to bet,
he's not coming home tonight.

31:45.403 --> 31:46.738
You know why?

31:46.821 --> 31:50.408
Because tonight,
that girl is going to just…

31:51.117 --> 31:53.578
Uh, you get me.

31:53.661 --> 31:56.331
No way he's coming home. Mm-mm. No way.

31:56.414 --> 31:57.457
You know what though?

31:58.041 --> 31:59.584
I honestly thought

31:59.667 --> 32:02.587
Won-jun was hopeless with girls
until today.

32:03.922 --> 32:06.674
He touched her face like this.
He was smooth.

32:08.176 --> 32:11.846
The way he alternated
between anger and then passion.

32:11.930 --> 32:13.264
And then anger some more.

32:13.973 --> 32:14.891
He's got the idea.

32:14.974 --> 32:17.143
It was impressive to see. Mm-hmm.

32:19.854 --> 32:22.440
So why are you waiting here?
Let's go inside.

32:22.941 --> 32:24.108
That's what I'm doing.

32:24.776 --> 32:25.610
Good night.

32:41.668 --> 32:42.502
I'm very sorry.

32:43.836 --> 32:45.129
I'm so sorry, ma'am.

32:45.630 --> 32:47.048
Sorry for the inconvenience.

32:50.635 --> 32:51.719
- Hey!
- What?

32:54.555 --> 32:56.140
Hey, Choi I-ra!

32:56.891 --> 32:59.185
- What?
- Come on. Wake up! Hey!

33:01.104 --> 33:03.064
Here, drink this.

33:07.944 --> 33:09.362
And have a bite of this.

33:20.623 --> 33:24.043
Hey, what the hell were you thinking,
trying to kiss me earlier?

33:24.919 --> 33:26.629
A kiss isn't that important.

33:26.713 --> 33:28.798
In Brazil, it's just how you say hi, okay?

33:28.881 --> 33:30.717
Well, we're not in Brazil, okay?

33:30.800 --> 33:32.927
In this country,
the customs are more strict.

33:34.387 --> 33:35.221
- Mmm.
- Ah.

33:35.304 --> 33:36.264
That's a crock of shit!

33:36.347 --> 33:39.100
Otherwise, your friends
wouldn't have acted like we were in Ibiza!

33:39.684 --> 33:41.769
- Sh.
- Just say it.

33:42.395 --> 33:45.523
You recognized me from the beginning,
so why did you act like that?

33:45.606 --> 33:48.109
Let's just say
I'm completely uninterested.

33:51.571 --> 33:53.364
- Hey!
- What?

33:57.493 --> 33:59.579
Tell me that you missed me, Won-jun.

33:59.662 --> 34:02.331
See what I mean?
This is why I didn't wanna say I knew you.

34:02.415 --> 34:05.251
If you sobered up, you should head home.
Where do you live? Is it close?

34:06.085 --> 34:07.587
Sorry to disappoint again.

34:09.422 --> 34:11.674
- I still live in the dorms, huh?
- Ugh!

34:11.758 --> 34:12.842
Hey.

34:13.718 --> 34:15.678
Cut it out. I need to go now, so let's go.

34:15.762 --> 34:18.473
Didn't you say we can walk together?

34:19.557 --> 34:22.894
You mean to say I have the privilege
of my ex-fiancé taking me home?

34:22.977 --> 34:25.730
Ah! Hey, get off me! Ugh!

34:25.813 --> 34:27.774
- You know you like it!
- No, I don't! Ugh, please!

34:27.857 --> 34:29.525
Hey, stop it!

34:29.609 --> 34:32.028
Ugh, would you quit it?
Give it a rest, huh?

34:41.079 --> 34:42.330
Hey, why are you crying?

34:43.706 --> 34:45.416
What's wrong? People are watching?

34:48.002 --> 34:50.755
Just so you know, I got dumped.

34:52.423 --> 34:55.051
Dos Santos, that son of a… of a bitch.

34:55.134 --> 34:58.930
All I needed was a new guy to date.

34:59.013 --> 35:02.100
I wanted Dos Santos to feel jealous,
but then you showed up.

35:02.183 --> 35:04.936
Why did it have to be you?

35:13.528 --> 35:15.446
Why you?

36:44.869 --> 36:45.828
Hmm?

36:51.250 --> 36:52.543
He returns.

36:52.627 --> 36:53.461
Yeah.

37:02.553 --> 37:03.804
You're still awake, huh?

37:04.680 --> 37:05.514
Mmm.

37:07.850 --> 37:09.477
What are you doing alone out here?

37:10.603 --> 37:12.021
My lights are not working.

37:13.189 --> 37:14.357
It's really dark inside.

37:15.524 --> 37:16.984
There must be a power outage.

37:17.693 --> 37:18.569
Oh, really?

37:21.530 --> 37:22.365
Huh.

37:22.949 --> 37:24.951
The second-floor lights are still working.

37:29.080 --> 37:31.207
Oh, uh, did you hurt your hand?

37:33.334 --> 37:34.168
Oh yeah.

37:35.336 --> 37:38.214
- I must've burned it smoking.
- Let me see.

37:41.926 --> 37:44.387
Ouch. Well, it must have just happened.

37:44.971 --> 37:45.930
Do you have any ice?

37:49.225 --> 37:50.059
In my kitchen.

37:55.648 --> 37:58.776
The refrigerator is still working,
so it's not a full power outage.

37:58.859 --> 38:00.945
Uh, I'll check the breaker panel for you.

38:05.866 --> 38:07.326
So I heard you went on a blind date?

38:08.577 --> 38:09.412
Yeah.

38:12.873 --> 38:14.166
So what do you do on one?

38:15.251 --> 38:17.503
Hmm, nothing unusual.

38:18.087 --> 38:20.214
Drink some beers, couple up,

38:20.798 --> 38:22.091
play childish games.

38:26.470 --> 38:28.097
You really reek of alcohol.

38:29.056 --> 38:30.016
Yeah.

38:31.058 --> 38:32.268
I had a lot to drink.

38:39.900 --> 38:42.278
You also reek of a women's perfume.
Why is that?

38:43.446 --> 38:45.865
Oh, it's, um, from the girl I was with.

38:49.869 --> 38:51.078
Okay, give me your hand.

39:07.595 --> 39:08.637
That's so weird.

39:09.764 --> 39:11.724
I was perfectly fine earlier tonight.

39:14.977 --> 39:18.022
So why do I suddenly feel pain
just because you've somehow noticed it?

39:19.273 --> 39:20.941
It's just the way it happens.

39:22.360 --> 39:24.487
There are times
you don't even realize you've been hurt.

39:25.446 --> 39:27.615
And as soon as you become aware of it,

39:27.698 --> 39:29.700
you finally notice it and it hurts.

39:29.784 --> 39:30.868
It's strange. I know.

39:36.040 --> 39:37.333
So that's the way it is, then?

39:38.000 --> 39:39.835
Yes, that's the way it is.

39:44.465 --> 39:46.008
Is that the reason I…

39:49.512 --> 39:50.846
I feel this way?

40:49.780 --> 40:51.574
TIME TO MOVE ON FROM
YOUR PAST RELATIONSHIP

40:51.657 --> 40:53.284
SEIZE EVERY OPPORTUNITY
TO CHANGE YOUR FATE
